{
  "tema": 5219,
  "slug": "construyeron-preterito-uir",
  "titulo": "-uir verbs in the preterite",
  "subtitulo": "Mi abuelo construyó la casa; nosotros construimos el huerto.",
  "foto": "t10.jpg",
  "regla": "Verbs ending in -uir (construir, destruir, incluir, contribuir, huir…) take regular -ir preterite endings, but the i becomes y in the third person: construyó, construyeron.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Verbs ending in **-uir** (**construir, destruir, incluir, contribuir, distribuir, concluir, huir**) use the regular -ir preterite endings."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "In **él/ella/usted** and **ellos/ellas/ustedes**, the unstressed **i** between two vowels becomes **y**: **construyó**, **construyeron**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "Construir",
            "Incluir"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "construí",
              "incluí"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "construiste",
              "incluiste"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "**construyó**",
              "**incluyó**"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros, nosotras",
              "construimos",
              "incluimos"
            ],
            [
              "ellos, ellas, ustedes",
              "**construyeron**",
              "**incluyeron**"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Yo** has an accent (**construí**); **tú** and **nosotros** don't (**construiste**, **construimos**)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It's the same **y** you see in **leyó** and **creyeron**. Tip: the **y** only shows up where **he** and **they** are."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Mi abuelo ==construyó== esta casa en los setenta.",
              "en": "My grandpa built this house in the seventies."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Construimos== unas camas elevadas para el huerto.",
              "en": "We built some raised beds for the garden."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Tú ==construiste== esa mesa solo?",
              "en": "Did you build that table by yourself?"
            },
            {
              "es": "La tormenta ==destruyó== parte del muelle.",
              "en": "The storm destroyed part of the pier."
            },
            {
              "es": "Los vecinos ==contribuyeron== con dinero para el parque.",
              "en": "The neighbors contributed money for the park."
            },
            {
              "es": "El precio ==incluyó== la renta de la tabla.",
              "en": "The price included the board rental."
            },
            {
              "es": "El ladrón ==huyó== en un carro rojo.",
              "en": "The thief fled in a red car."
            },
            {
              "es": "La maestra ==concluyó== la clase con un repaso.",
              "en": "The teacher ended the class with a review."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
